  "summary": "VPWS (Virtual Private Wire Service) point-to-point pseudowire between 2 PEs. Delivers a transparent Ethernet EPL or EVPL to the customer -- whatever enters one AC exits the other. The simplest L2VPN: no MAC learning, no BUM replication. Billing / metro E-Line flagship.",
